### ============================================================
###  USERS – Spanish Poker Dice API
###  Base: http://localhost:8476/api
###
###  Auth: Send x-user-role header to identify as:
###    anonymous  – read-only access (default if omitted)
###    registered – can update own profile
###    admin      – can delete users
###
###  SETUP: Run "GET /api/users" first, then copy a real userId
###         into the @uid variable below before running the
###         single-user requests.
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8476/api

# Replace with a real userId from the GET /users response
@uid = 4904147198225416


### 1. Get all users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users


### 2. Get a single user by userId
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{uid}}


### 3. Get all games for a user
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{uid}}/games


### 4. Create a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "TestPlayer1",
    "email": "testplayer1@mail.no",
    "pwd": "Test1234",
    "age": 25
}


### 5. Update a user (email / pwd / age / banned – username cannot be changed)
# Requires: registered or admin
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{uid}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-role: registered

{
    "email": "updated@mail.no"
}


### 5b. Ban or unban a user (set banned: true or false)
# Requires: admin
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{uid}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-role: admin

{
    "banned": true
}

### 6. Search users by username or email (admin use)
# Returns users whose username or email contains the search string
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?search=test
x-user-role: admin


### 7. Filter users by username
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?username=player
x-user-role: admin


### 8. Delete a user
# Requires: admin
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{uid}}
x-user-role: admin
